31||bib18|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10873096</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nowicki</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ostalska-Nowicka</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaczmarek</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Miskowiak</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Witt</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Vascular endothelial growth factor C&#x02014;a potent risk factor in childhood acute lymphoblastic leukaemia: an immunocytochemical approach</article-title><source>Histopathology</source><year>2006</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>170</fpage><lpage>177</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Histopathology||49|170||bib19|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16879394</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ogawa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>LaRue</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Drake</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hematopoietic origin of fibroblasts/myofibroblasts: its pathophysiologic implications</article-title><source>Blood</source><year>2006</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>2893</fpage><lpage>2896</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Blood||108|2893||bib20|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16840726</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Onogawa</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitadai</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanaka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuwai</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kimura</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chayama<